# Training logs written by SLURM and TensorBoard during a run. Scratch
# output; the per-policy record that matters is train_meta.json and the
# .provenance.json sidecar, both versioned here alongside the weights.
rl/logs/

# NOTE ON WHAT IS *NOT* EXCLUDED.
# The 51 trained SAC policies (rl/runs*/**/model.zip, 159 MB) and the cached
# steady-state map (.npz) ARE versioned, deliberately. A checkpoint is not
# reproducible from its commit, seed and configs/reactor_params.yaml alone:
# this project's own central finding is that ten policies trained on
# identical data with identical hyperparameters, differing only in random
# seed, span 2.05 to 3.04 times in delivered profit. Retraining reproduces
# the distribution, not these ten policies, so the weights are the only way
# to check the numbers reported in Chapter 5.

# Working notes, not part of the published repo.
docs/
PHASE0_PROVENANCE.md
